WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:42.160
[A hospital scene is shown with a doctor sitting behind a desk and a man in a suit sitting next to the desk. There is a jar on the desk. There are fabric screens behind them.]

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:46.750
[A close up of the jar is shown. There is a label on the jar that says, "Calomel Ointment."]

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:56.510
[The doctor opens the jar and dips his fingers in the ointment. The doctor smears the ointment on one of his fingers.]

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:44.940
[Pharmaceutical preparations in boxes or bottles are shown.]

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:56.510
[A table is shown with a glass bottle with a stopper and a glass.]

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:06.310
[Liquid is poured from the bottle to the glass.]

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:20.630
[A close up is shown of powder from a small bottle being added to the liquid in the glass.]

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:32.990
[The liquid is shown being pulled up into a syringe.]

00:02:32.990 --> 00:03:04.420
[A close up of an arm with a tattoo is shown. The arm is sterilized and the syringe with needle is inserted into the arm. The liquid is pushed slowly from the syringe into the vein.]

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:16.120
[A doctor is shown with a male patient. The doctor is tapping the chest of the man.]

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:25.490
[The doctor listens to the patient's breathing using a stethoscope.]

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:33.630
[The doctor takes the blood pressure of the patient.]

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:39.120
[The doctor is shown giving an eye test to the patient.]

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:45.490
[The doctor lifts the eyelids of the patient and looks in them.]

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:01.950
[There is a room shown with a patient almost completely enclosed in a machine. Only the head of the patient is sticking out. There is a small table next to the machine with a fan on it.]

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:08.510
[A technician wipes the head of the patient and then checks something inside the machine.]

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:15.960
[Close-up of the technician wiping the forehead of the person in the machine and then giving them a drink.]

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.080
[The patient is shown still in the machine.]

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.320
[The technician checks a printout on the machine.]

00:04:51.690 --> 00:05:02.210
[A man is shown in a hospital bed. A nurse and a doctor take a blood sample.]

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:05.800
[A doctor is shown sitting behind a desk and a man is seated with his back to the camera beside the desk.]

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.130
[The doctor is talking to the man and writing something down.]

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:24.110
[The man stands up, removes his jacket and sits back down. The doctor ties a tourniquet around the man's arm.]

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:34.900
[The doctor takes a syringe out of a box and prepares the man's arm for taking blood.]

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:45.100
[A doctor is seated at a desk. He rises as a couple comes into the room.]

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:51.750
[The man stands in front of the desk and the woman sits in the chair next to the desk with her back to the camera. The doctor sits back down.]

00:05:51.750 --> 00:06:04.290
[The doctor ties a tourniquet on the woman's upper arm and prepares to take blood.]

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:20.820
[The woman is now standing in front of the desk and the man is seated by the desk. The doctor ties the tourniquet onto the man's arm.]

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.970
[The woman opens the door and enters the clinic.]

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:42.510
[The woman approaches a desk with another woman seated at it. This woman points off camera and the first woman turns in that direction.]

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:47.110
[The woman approaches a desk with a doctor seated behind it and sits down in a chair next to the desk with her back to the door.]

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.340
[The doctor talks to the woman and writes something down.]

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:53.880
[The doctor stands up and ties a tourniquet onto the woman's upper arm.]

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:31.470
[Close-up of a child's mouth. Someone's hands are holding the lips away from the mouth and pointing out problems with the teeth.]

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:41.150
[A girl is shown facing the camera and then a man turns her head to show a deformity of the chin and facial structure.]

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:51.380
[Another girl is shown with severe deformities of the facial structure. Her head is gradually turned so she is facing the camera.]

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:59.550
[A boy is shown facing the camera. He has deformities and does not look normal.]

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:23.890
[A man, woman and baby are shown outside sitting in the grass. The woman is holding the baby. The couple are playing with the child.]

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:11.410
[A woman is shown seated behind a desk. A man enters the room and sits down in a chair next to the desk with his back to the camera.]

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:22.740
[The man and woman are talking.]

00:09:56.590 --> 00:10:00.740
[A laboratory is shown with three men working with scientific equipment.]

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:18.470
[A male scientist is shown looking into a microscope and adjusting the focus]

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:35.430
[A female scientist is shown working with scientific equipment. She puts a slide under the microscope and adjusts the focus]

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:46.070
[Close-up of equipment which slices something thinly. These slices are then put into a glass dish half-filled with solution.]

00:10:46.070 --> 00:11:03.490
[A male scientist removes something from a covered Petri dish and puts it on a slide.]

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:38.320
[A man is shown walking down the street.]

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.570
[The man stops and looks up at the building.]

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:51.270
[The man enters the building as another man walks down the street.]

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.510
[The man walks up to a desk in the building which has a nurse seated behind it.]

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.790
[The nurse points to a hallway and the man turns and walks down the hallway.]

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:19.240
[Bottles, boxes and advertisements relating to syphilis are shown]

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:21.340
[A man is in a hallway looking at an advertisment on the wall]

